  "details": "When in in FullBody or dancing in an MMD dance world the frames for any avatar other than yours in movement drops their avatars frames low. They have jagged movements as if they are lagging. I heard that was a part of the update, but messaging a mod it seems not to be. People in Dirty Dancers was complaining about it, and when I went to an MMD world I realized the same problem persisted there as well. Again, your personal model doesn't look laggy, it's any one else with full body movement that is laggy looking.",
